senses.gloss:
1. अह् (defect. verb, only perf. 3. sg. आ॑ह and 3. pl. आहुः॑, RV.; AV. &c., 2. sg. आत्थ, ŚBr. xiv (BṛĀrUp.), N.; Ragh. iii, 48 3. du. आहतुः, Pāṇ. viii, 2, 35)
to say, speak, RV. &c.;
 (with lexicographers) to express, signify;
to call (by name, नाम्ना), MBh. iii, 16065;
to call, hold, consider, regard as (with two acc., for one of which may be substituted a phrase with इति), RV. &c.;
to state or declare with reference to (acc.), BṛĀrUp.; Śak.; Megh.;
to acknowledge, accept, state, AitBr.; Mn. &c.;
to adjudge anything (acc.) to any one (gen.), Mn. ix, 44.
